[I] Jasmine test framework runner for GJS (GNOME JavaScript)

[T] jasmine-gjs runs Jasmine, a behavior-driven development framework for
[T] JavaScript, against GJS code and reports the results on the terminal,
[T] making it usable as a test runner for GNOME JavaScript projects.

[U] https://github.com/ptomato/jasmine-gjs

[A] Philip Chimento <philip.chimento@gmail.com>
